---
import TreatmentLayout from '../../components/TreatmentLayout.astro';
import PriceBlock from '../../components/PriceBlock.astro';
import { curlyHaircuts, hairCare } from '../../data/services';
import { images } from '../../data/images';
const curlTreatment = hairCare.find((g) => g.id === 'curl-treatment')!;
---

<TreatmentLayout
  title="Curls"
  metaTitle="Curly haircuts and curl care"
  description="Curly haircuts at Maison Coiffure: cut dry to enhance your natural curl pattern, €49 including curl consultation, wash, curl care and styling. Curl treatments from €39."
  lede="Curly hair needs a different approach from straight hair."
  image={images.curlsLong}
  waMessage="Hello Maison Coiffure, I would like to book a curly haircut."
>
  <p>
    It is about tailoring the cut to your unique curl pattern, understanding its natural movement,
    shape and texture, and enhancing it rather than flattening it. We take time to observe how your
    hair naturally falls and cut curls dry, so the pattern stays visible. The aim is a shape that
    suits your face, style and lifestyle.
  </p>
  <p>
    Expect a calm, personalised treatment, advice on caring for and styling your curls, and a
    haircut that allows your natural texture to shine.
  </p>
  <p>
    Alongside the cut, curl care nourishes and hydrates the hair, reduces frizz and supports natural
    definition. The curly haircut and the curl treatment are separate services, so you can choose
    what your hair needs.
  </p>

  <Fragment slot="after">
    <PriceBlock group={curlyHaircuts} headingLevel="h2" />
    <PriceBlock group={curlTreatment} headingLevel="h2" />
  </Fragment>
</TreatmentLayout>
